{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>I am Esav your firstborn.</b> That is, since the birthright was acquired from Esav, behold he has become Esav with respect to the aspect of the birthright, for the birthright is called Esav his firstborn. And his saying <b>I have done as you spoke to me</b> — meaning, for the reason you commanded Esav is that he is your firstborn son, and since he [Yaakov] has taken the birthright, it is as though the matter has come to him."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:43:46.257113872Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}